    },
    {
      "id": "intro_5",
      "role": "Narrator",
      "text": "Some time ago, an interesting discovery was made by archaeologists on the Aegean island of Kea.",
      "translation": "前不久，考古学家在爱琴海的基亚岛上有一个有趣的发现。",
