    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "role": "Man",
      "text": "An American team explored a temple which stands in an ancient city on the promontory of Ayia Irini.",
      "translation": "一个美国考古队在阿业·依里尼海角的一座古城里考察了一座庙宇。",
      "startTime": 24.33,
      "endTime": 32.7,
      "analysis": {
        "words": [
          {
