    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "Woman",
      "text": "The temple which the archaeologists explored was used as a place of worship from the fifteenth century B.C. until Roman times.",
      "translation": "考古学家考察的这座庙宇，从公元前15世纪直到罗马时代一直被用作祭祀场所。",
